          "**Internal A/B validation build — do not distribute.** This render embeds the "
          "© <Year> <Author> original figures beside the reproduction for side-by-side "
          "checking; it is local-only and must never be committed. The public build is "
          "report.pdf, which omits every original.\n:::\n")
